§ `ss 34, 37(1) -- the occupier's duties`

#ASSERT `Have I committed an offence by not reporting a wasting pipe` `a tenant living in the flat` TRUE TRUE FALSE

#ASSERT `Am I guilty because the supply was reinstated without authority` `a tenant living in the flat` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Am I guilty because the supply was reinstated without authority` `a tenant living in the flat` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE

